    # "It's a long, sweet kiss. A kiss that tries to make up for a month without kisses."
    "C'est un long et doux baiser. Un baiser qui essaie de compenser un mois sans baisers."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4800
translate french c32s007_teaser_cbde9341:

    # eva "I missed you so much too."
    eva "Tu m'as tellement manqué aussi."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4801
translate french c32s007_teaser_23f83be6:

    # mc "Me too, sweetheart."
    mc "Moi aussi, ma chérie."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4802
translate french c32s007_teaser_cac15f92:

    # "Your hug is long too. Not as long as the two girls', but it serves as an appetizer for the month of hugs to come."
    "Votre étreinte est longue aussi. Pas aussi longue que celle des deux filles, mais elle sert de mise en bouche pour le mois de câlins à venir."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4804
translate french c32s007_teaser_4529c22c:

    # eva "What did you guys do to [car]? She gave me a super long hug. It's not like her."
    eva "Qu'est-ce que vous avez fait à [car] ? Elle m'a fait un super long câlin. Ça ne lui ressemble pas."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4805
translate french c32s007_teaser_30412b3e:

    # mc "*Laugh* I think she's getting a little Marksified."
    mc "*Rires* Je crois qu'elle devient un peu Marksifiée."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4807
translate french c32s007_teaser_a871a1c8:

    # ama "A lot of things have started to change around here."
    ama "Beaucoup de choses ont commencé à changer par ici."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4808
translate french c32s007_teaser_ca5826cd:

    # ama "Having [mc] and Aunt [bet] around has made even [aar] accept hugs."
    ama "Avoir [mc] et tante [bet] dans les parages a même poussé [aar] à accepter les câlins."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4810
translate french c32s007_teaser_ec8818de:

    # mc "We thought about taking you out for lunch, but we didn't know how long it would take you to get here from the airport."
    mc "On a pensé à t'emmener déjeuner, mais on ne savait pas combien de temps tu mettrais pour arriver ici depuis l'aéroport."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4811
translate french c32s007_teaser_1c1a610f:

    # eva "Well, I broke every speed limit on the island to get here as fast as possible."
    eva "Eh bien, j'ai enfreint toutes les limitations de vitesse de l'île pour arriver ici le plus vite possible."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4813
translate french c32s007_teaser_7349b444:
# eva "But I have other plans."
    eva "Mais j'ai d'autres projets."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4815
translate french c32s007_teaser_2fd1ba2a:

    # eva "[ama], you can stay or leave. I hope you stay."
    eva "[ama], tu peux rester ou partir. J'espère que tu vas rester."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4816
translate french c32s007_teaser_7b59c9bf:

    # eva "But I plan on taking our husband into that back room right now."
    eva "Mais j'ai l'intention d'emmener notre mari dans cette arrière-salle tout de suite."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4817
translate french c32s007_teaser_add4c3f7:

    # eva "I think [aar] and Aunt [bet] will have to wait a while for their hug."
    eva "Je pense qu'[aar] et tante [bet] vont devoir attendre un peu pour leur câlin."

# game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:4820
translate french c32s007_teaser_b99705dc:

    # eva "Going out to eat sounds like a fantastic idea. I'm looking forward to seeing [aar] and Aunt [bet]."
    eva "Sortir manger me semble être une idée fantastique. J'ai hâte de voir [aar] et tante [bet]."

translate french strings:

    # game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3470
    old "Permitirlo."
    new "L'autoriser."

    # game/scripts/c32/c32.rpy:3470
    old "No permitirlo"
    new "Ne pas l'autoriser"
